<tr><td>How paid</td><td>By the insurer</td><td>By the policyholder, under a written contract; capped at 10% of the settlement in Texas</td></tr>
<tr><td>Main job</td><td>Investigate, apply the policy, recommend payment</td><td>Document, estimate, and present the claim; negotiate for the policyholder</td></tr>
<tr><td>Writes an estimate</td><td>Yes, for the insurer</td><td>Yes, for the policyholder</td></tr>
<tr><td>Decides the claim</td><td>Recommends; the insurer decides</td><td>No; presents and negotiates</td></tr>
<tr><td>Texas licensing</td><td>Generally licensed by TDI under separate adjuster rules</td><td>Licensed by TDI under Insurance Code Chapter 4102</td></tr>
